							<a href="https://clinicaportada.cl/blog/" title="Blog">
								Blog							</a>
						</li>
												<li class="separator template-arrow-horizontal-1">&nbsp;</li>
						<li class="current">¿Tienes una cirugía pendiente?</li>
										</ul>
			</div>
					</div>
	</div>
	<div data-rocket-location-hash="f7c7ccfb46115446bed666feb254e126" class="clearfix">
		<div class="wpb-content-wrapper" id="wpb-content-root"><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-8"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><ul class="blog clearfix page-margin-top-section"><li class="single post post-7510 type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-noticias"><ul class="comment-box clearfix"><li class="date clearfix animated-element animation-slideRight">
						<div class="value">26 AGOSTO, 2020</div>
						<div class="arrow-date"></div>
					</li><li class="comments-number animated-element animation-slideUp duration-300 delay-500">		<a href="https://clinicaportada.cl/tienes-una-cirugia-pendiente/#respond" title="0 COMMENTS">0 COMMENTS</a>
					</li></ul><div class="post-content"><a class="post-image fancybox" href="https://clinicaportada.cl/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/cirugia-pendiente--1024x576.webp" title="¿Tienes una cirugía pendiente?"><span class="mc-preloader"></span><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="670" height="446" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20670%20446'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="attachment-blog-post-thumb size-blog-post-thumb wp-post-image" alt="¿Tienes una cirugía pendiente?" title="" data-lazy-srcset="https://clinicaportada.cl/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/cirugia-pendiente--670x446.webp 670w, https://clinicaportada.cl/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/cirugia-pendiente--600x400.webp 600w, https://clinicaportada.cl/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/cirugia-pendiente--480x320.webp 480w, https://clinicaportada.cl/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/cirugia-pendiente--390x260.webp 390w, https://clinicaportada.cl/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/cirugia-pendiente--285x190.webp 285w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 670px) 100vw, 670px" data-lazy-src="https://clinicaportada.cl/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/cirugia-pendiente--670x446.webp" /><noscript><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="670" height="446" src="https://clinicaportada.cl/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/cirugia-pendiente--670x446.webp" class="attachment-blog-post-thumb size-blog-post-thumb wp-post-image" alt="¿Tienes una cirugía pendiente?" title="" srcset="https://clinicaportada.cl/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/cirugia-pendiente--670x446.webp 670w, https://clinicaportada.cl/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/cirugia-pendiente--600x400.webp 600w, https://clinicaportada.cl/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/cirugia-pendiente--480x320.webp 480w, https://clinicaportada.cl/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/cirugia-pendiente--390x260.webp 390w, https://clinicaportada.cl/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/cirugia-pendiente--285x190.webp 285w" sizes="(max-width: 670px) 100vw, 670px" /></noscript></a><h1 class="post-title">¿Tienes una cirugía pendiente?</h1><div class="wpb-content-wrapper" id="wpb-content-root"><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><span style="color: #333333;">El Ministerio de Salud ha levantado la restricción a la realización de cirugías electivas en los establecimientos de salud.</span></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><span style="color: #333333;"><br /></span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="color: #333333;">Porque nos preocupamos por tu salud y bienestar,<strong> te invitamos a retomar tus tratamientos pendientes.</strong></span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img decoding="async" class="wp-image-7032" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%200%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="" data-lazy-src="https://www.hospitalclinicodelsur.cl/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/unnamed-3-1.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="wp-image-7032" src="https://www.hospitalclinicodelsur.cl/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/unnamed-3-1.jpg" alt="" /></noscript></figure>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img decoding="async" class="wp-image-7033" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%200%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="" data-lazy-src="https://www.hospitalclinicodelsur.cl/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/unnamed-4.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" class="wp-image-7033" src="https://www.hospitalclinicodelsur.cl/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/unnamed-4.jpg" alt="" /></noscript></figure>
<p><span style="color: #333333;">Acércate a nuestra Clínica a través de nuestro sitio web <a style="color: #333333;" href="https://clinicaportada.cl/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" aria-label=" (se abre en una nueva pestaña)"><strong>www.clinicaportada.cl</strong></a> o al teléfono <a style="color: #333333;" href="tel: 56552 694200">+ (56) 552 694200</a>, y contacta a tu médico tratante lo antes posible.</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div class="wp-block-spacer" style="height: 27px;" aria-hidden="true"> </div>
<p><span style="color: #333333;"><br /></span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2 class="has-text-color has-text-align-center wp-block-heading" style="color: #162c9f;">No olvides agendar tu hora con nosotros.</h2>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div class="wp-block-spacer" style="height: 27px;" aria-hidden="true"> </div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div class="wp-block-button aligncenter is-style-fill"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-background" style="background-color: #162c9f;" href="https://patientportal.prod.regionales.procloudhub.com/#/patientPortal/redirect?externalCenterId=PORTADA@1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">agenda tu hora</a></div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"> </p>

